              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩvinda yĩu anene ma mbee ũsumbĩnĩ ma Avilisiti maumaala: na kweethĩwa, o yĩla maumaalaa, Ndaviti eeyĩkalasya na kĩlĩko kĩnene kũte athũkũmi onthe ma Saulo; kũvika syĩtwa yake yataĩĩwa mũno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.30"
            ]
          }
